### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@api = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@email = test.user@example.com
@password = SecurePass123!
@displayName = Test User

### 1. Health Liveness Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### 2. Readiness Probe (Database & AI Service)
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz

### 3. Status Page
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 4. Register
# @name register
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "displayName": "{{displayName}}"
}

### Store Access Token from Register
@accessToken = {{register.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. Login
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 6. Refresh Token (Rotates HTTP-only cookie)
# @name refresh
POST {{api}}/auth/refresh

### 7. Get Profile
GET {{api}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Update Profile
PATCH {{api}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Updated User",
  "timezone": "Asia/Kolkata",
  "occupationType": "professional",
  "workStart": "10:00",
  "workEnd": "18:00"
}

### 9. Get Goals
GET {{api}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Create Goal
# @name createGoal
POST {{api}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "focus_minutes",
  "period": "daily",
  "targetValue": 120
}

### 11. Request Device Pairing Code
# @name pairingCode
POST {{api}}/devices/pairing-code
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Store Pairing Code
@code = {{pairingCode.response.body.code}}

### 12. Pair Device (Public endpoint)
# @name pairDevice
POST {{api}}/devices/pair
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{code}}",
  "deviceName": "Chrome Work Laptop"
}

### Store Device Token
@deviceToken = {{pairDevice.response.body.deviceToken}}

### 13. Ingest Activity Telemetry (Device Token)
POST {{api}}/ingest/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
    {
      "clientEventId": "evt-001",
      "domain": "github.com",
      "startedAt": "2026-10-17T06:00:00.000Z",
      "endedAt": "2026-10-17T06:30:00.000Z",
      "idle": false
    }
  ]
}

### 14. Ingest Context Switches (Device Token)
POST {{api}}/ingest/switches
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
    {
      "clientEventId": "sw-001",
      "fromApp": "Visual Studio Code",
      "toApp": "Google Chrome",
      "switchedAt": "2026-10-17T06:15:00.000Z"
    }
  ]
}

### 15. Ingest Notification Events (Device Token)
POST {{api}}/ingest/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
    {
      "clientEventId": "notif-001",
      "sourceApp": "Slack",
      "receivedAt": "2026-10-17T06:20:00.000Z"
    }
  ]
}

### 16. Ingest Heartbeat
POST {{api}}/ingest/heartbeat
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}

### 17. Get Activity Summary
GET {{api}}/activity/summary?date=2026-10-17
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 18. Logout (Clears refresh cookie)
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
